WEBVTT

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:15.760
Don't miss that brightly shining light!

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:20.870
It's always there beside you.

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:26.420
I'm sure the rest just depends on your perception.

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:31.590
You don't have to search for it—just notice that it's there!

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:37.350
There's a tenderness that lies hidden behind the most common things:

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:43.230
a light that showers our days in color!

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:49.230
Tiny Days: This world is constructed...

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:54.800
Tiny Days: ...by fragments of miracles!

00:00:54.800 --> 00:01:00.180
Things that seemed meaningless

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:05.730
were actually protecting us, loving us, more than we ever knew.

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:10.960
Tiny Heart: Our feelings flow forth...

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:16.000
Tiny Heart: ...as we give thanks for everything we've been given.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:21.490
We'll never, ever forget...

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:27.700
We'll cherish this feeling forevermore!

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:35.000
Ah, I'll Catch a Cold

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:44.870
I caught a cold.

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:46.930
Learning Mode: Cold.

00:01:46.930 --> 00:01:48.510
Data acquisition complete.

00:01:48.510 --> 00:01:50.460
A viral-induced acute inflammatory disorder.

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:54.270
Known as "the common cold," it is an acute illness of the upper respiratory tract.

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:56.360
In medical terminology, nasopharyngitis.

00:01:56.360 --> 00:02:02.620
Symptoms include fever, coughing, sneezing, sore throat, chills, headaches and joint pain.

00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:04.410
I... see?

00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:05.820
I think I get it.

00:02:05.820 --> 00:02:07.310
Nah, I don't.

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:09.620
Perhaps she's not trying hard enough.

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:12.940
Oh, my. Don't they say only fools catch colds?

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:14.860
That fits Ao-chan to a T.

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:17.700
Ao, what is it like to catch a cold?

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:22.470
Well, I have a fever, but I also have chills...

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:24.720
So then they balance each other out, right?

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:27.050
My joints hurt...

00:02:27.050 --> 00:02:29.940
Should we take your limbs off and use some silicon spray?

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:31.890
My head hurts too!

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:33.440
You're sick in the head, you mean.

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:34.980
And always have been.

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:36.480
I have a runny nose...

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:39.080
You should plug your nostrils. I'll bring some putty.

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:40.730
And I... have a cough!

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:42.780
You should fill your mouth with putty as well.

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:48.430
Shut up already!
Humans aren't put together like that!

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:53.500
Oh... Uh-oh. Now my fever has... really...

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:55.670
Ao?!

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:04.760
I still don't understand these "colds" very well,

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:08.840
but Architect has identified some items said to be effective against them.

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:10.680
Let's all go search for them!

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:11.870
Okay!
Understood.

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.470
If Ao lies to the east with a cold...

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:26.200
We will see to her needs!

00:03:30.070 --> 00:03:33.310
And if she lies to the south and seems at death's door...

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:38.280
We shall tend to her on her deathbed!

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:51.000
Ao. Wake up.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:51.900
Ao!

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:54.520
Gou... rai?

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:57.190
We've all gone out to find things to cure your cold.

00:03:57.190 --> 00:03:58.560
This will make you better!

00:04:01.270 --> 00:04:03.260
The heck is all this?!

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:06.650
These will cure your cold!

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:12.580
Yeah, but still...

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:17.250
These chickens are alive.

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:18.750
They're not just chickens...

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:22.500
They're Silkies! Their eggs are packed with nutrition!

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:24.630
You could've just given me the eggs...

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:26.160
They're best when they're freshly laid!

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.720
Just wait. They'll lay some soon.

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:35.460
Watching won't make them lay any faster!

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:36.880
Hey, Ao!

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:42.550
We've got soft-shelled turtle soup, shark's fin, and swallow's nest!

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:46.800
Over here is foie gras,
as well as caviar and Chateaubriand steak!

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.780
Base-dono, you know nothing, do you?

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:53.980
Being expensive doesn't make something good!

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:57.100
Fine. Jinrai, what did <i>you</i> bring?

00:04:58.450 --> 00:04:59.460
This!

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:03.680
Learning Mode: Aralia cordata.
Data acquisition complete.

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:05.880
A perennial green and member of the Araliaceae family.

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:10.590
Its main nutrients are chlorogenic acid, flavonoids, and aspartic acid,

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:14.140
as well as Vitamins B1, B2, folate, and potassium.

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:18.850
Diterpene aldehyde, its aromatic component, is beneficial to the circulatory system.

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:22.140
This is from the first crop of the season, and is said to bring good luck.

00:05:22.140 --> 00:05:25.400
This vegetable is a staple of Japanese culture,
thus making it ideal!

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:27.860
That's right. Leeks are good too.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.260
Once they're nice and charred.

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:32.270
White and Black are actually talking sense.

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:34.560
They say you should stick them in your anus!

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:36.270
No way!

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:40.410
Huh? What's this?

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:42.210
A cell phone strap for Demon Park?

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:43.690
Ah. That's from me.

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:48.210
In ancient times, sickness was said to have been caused by demons.

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:52.380
So I thought, maybe I could get you a good demon to look after you.

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:59.460
Gourai... regardless of whether it works or not, your thoughtfulness has made me happy!

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:01.480
Really?

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:02.860
In that case, there's more!

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:06.720
A Demon Park plush doll, a Demon Park Pillow, and a Demon Park poseable figurine!

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:10.660
A Demon Park coffee mug, Demon Park coin purse,
and a Demon Park tapestry!

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:12.470
Also... Also...!

00:06:15.530 --> 00:06:18.160
Oh no! Ao's taken a turn for the worse!

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:20.950
Uh oh! Hang on a minute.

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:24.540
They say it's good to add pepper to honey because it warms the body.

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:25.990
I'll help!

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:27.380
Pepper and...

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:28.680
ginger and...

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:30.060
wasabi and...

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:31.460
garlic!

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:33.050
And chili pepper!

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:37.910
Base, you're taking things too far.

00:06:44.310 --> 00:06:47.560
This just won't do, everyone.
You need to look at the big picture.

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:50.820
Indeed. Curing the common cold is a global issue.

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:54.110
There's the snake treatment:
you let them crawl all over your body.

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:55.990
There's also the cactus massage.

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:58.370
It pricks and is <i>so</i> very effective.

00:06:58.370 --> 00:07:01.600
Now strip. Take it all off.

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:06.340
Wait! We should light a sacrificial fire!

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:09.460
This calls for ritual prayer!

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:11.630
No, aloe and bishop's weed!

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:13.850
Grilled pickled plums!

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:19.510
Speaking of grilled, you should have some newt.

00:07:19.510 --> 00:07:22.580
Apparently, it's quite effective.

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:26.730
I shall install a cold virus removal program.

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:34.190
Look, just leave me alone!

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:44.040
Let... me... sleep...

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:48.190
Ao!

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:51.960
We've failed to nurse her back to health.

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:56.160
What should we do?
At this rate, she'll... she'll...!

00:07:56.160 --> 00:08:00.720
She'll be fine. Idiots always are.
A cold won't get her down.

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:05.210
But it looks like we've only made things worse for her!

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:07.680
All we did was stress methods of treatment.

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:10.350
We didn't consider how Ao-dono felt.

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:12.610
They do say that health starts in the mind...

00:08:12.610 --> 00:08:15.780
Still, it's not as if we know what to do.

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:17.860
Optimize? Defragment?

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:27.730
Ao.

00:08:28.210 --> 00:08:31.630
Ao. What do you need?

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:34.840
What should we do?

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:35.840
Ao...

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:42.040
I want to eat some apples. Grated apples.

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:47.100
My mom used to feed me that as a kid when I caught a cold.

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:48.020
Okay!

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:29.730
Ao, is there anything else you want? Are you thirsty?

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:31.390
Are you cold?

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:35.020
Gourai, you sound like my mom.

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:40.020
My mom and dad were always so kind whenever I caught a cold.

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:45.960
Even if I was acting a little spoiled,
they always listened and stayed by my side.

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:48.740
I felt happy that they'd take such good care of me.

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:50.860
Please, be as spoiled as you like!

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:54.000
Ao, just hurry up and get better.

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:56.360
Yeah, I'll be fine.

00:09:56.360 --> 00:10:01.380
It sure is nice having someone close by when you're sick.

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:04.470
Everyone... thank you.

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:24.990
Together Again Tomorrow
Together Again Tomorrow

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:03.050
Hello?

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:05.280
Oh, good morning, Gourai.

00:11:06.070 --> 00:11:09.060
Yeah, I'm fine. I'm up and about!

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:13.240
In that case, I'll see you at the monorail station at 9:00 as planned.

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:16.320
You bet. Looking forward to it! Okay, see you later.

00:11:27.930 --> 00:11:29.580
Gourai!

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:31.080
'Morning!

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:33.500
Good morning, Ao.

00:11:53.910 --> 00:11:56.020
I swear, you two!

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:02.360
Here. Your tickets.

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:04.040
I bought them ahead of time.

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:08.300
They told Base she's free because she's "still in elementary school."

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:09.760
Talk about rude!

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:12.250
I'm a genius, you know!

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:16.680
Uh, well, you <i>do</i> look like you're in elementary school...

00:12:16.680 --> 00:12:20.760
I've skipped so many grades that I'm in college already!

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:22.770
You <i>really</i> don't look like it, though.

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:25.150
The wise hawk hides its talons!

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:29.060
Huh? Where's Jinrai?

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:30.400
My apologies!

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:35.120
I overslept somewhat.

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:37.680
I shall bear that burden for life.

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:40.130
Well, let's go!

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:42.880
Jinrai has to treat us all to something!

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:44.490
I suppose it cannot be helped.

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:36.260
That was fun!

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:37.430
What did you like the most?

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:39.010
Sure enough, the animals that can fly.

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:42.670
Flying animals, right? Gourai, you...

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:53.610
Damn you! Perish!

00:13:53.610 --> 00:13:54.820
Oh no!

00:13:55.820 --> 00:13:57.480
These shoes are brand new.

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.540
We should hurry home and dry them.

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:00.870
Yeah, you're right...

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:04.740
Oh! Sty-ko and Base should've just flown ahead!

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:13.920
Huh? What are you talking about, Ao?

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:15.680
How could we possibly fly?

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:19.180
Wait, what? You're right...
What am I saying?

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:23.480
Ao, maybe <i>you</i> can fly.

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:26.310
Given how little weight she has in her brain, it's possible.

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:29.310
Being able to fly would be great, huh?

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:32.900
You jest.

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:46.870
Everyone, meet your new friend.

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:49.360
This is Architect-chan.

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:43.540
Reminiscing with this album,

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:49.880
I realize we took so many photos.

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:53.010
"Oh yeah, this did happen."

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:57.520
"And this too."

00:16:57.520 --> 00:17:03.560
I quietly muttered.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:10.050
I felt all of those memories

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:16.300
flowing back when I closed my eyes.

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:19.750
If I were to gently reach out for them

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:24.380
they would suddenly disappear,

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:29.750
so I'll keep them in my heart.

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:33.000
As long as I'm with everyone,

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:36.190
even if things get hard

00:17:36.190 --> 00:17:43.100
or times are lonely,

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:46.260
the happy things,

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:50.910
and the sad ones too,

00:17:50.910 --> 00:18:00.140
are all my important treasures!

00:18:02.950 --> 00:18:08.240
The seasons keep on passing by.

00:18:08.240 --> 00:18:09.290
Wow... it's graduation day, huh?

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:11.620
Although spring is already here,

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:13.960
Seems like a dream, doesn't it?

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:14.840
Although spring is already here,

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:16.430
Base, you'll be going home, won't you?

00:18:16.430 --> 00:18:17.400
I will never forget.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:20.740
Yup. But I'll come back to Japan once in a while.
I will never forget.

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:21.020
I will never forget.

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:22.720
Those of us heading to college will be going our separate ways.

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:24.320
From that day on,

00:18:24.320 --> 00:18:25.990
Toward the next program...

00:18:25.990 --> 00:18:32.750
we'll always be together forever.

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:34.180
Oh dear.

00:18:34.180 --> 00:18:36.900
These poor kittens don't seem too lively.

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:39.900
Perhaps they need some consoling...

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:41.900
Materia-sensei!

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:45.140
Thank you for the past three years!

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:48.960
I feel I sort of dragged the others down with their studies...

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:50.150
You did.

00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:52.650
She said it!

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:56.880
Feel free to come visit.

00:18:56.880 --> 00:19:00.780
Should you ever feel buffeted by the waves of fate...

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:02.210
You're always welcome.

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:04.620
Sensei...

00:19:04.960 --> 00:19:08.250
We shall flay the skin from your bones.

00:19:17.770 --> 00:19:19.100
Ao?

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:20.080
Ao!

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:21.280
Ao.

00:19:21.280 --> 00:19:22.150
Ao!

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:32.660
Ao?

00:19:32.660 --> 00:19:34.910
No, it's nothing.

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:39.000
Even after we've graduated...

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:45.220
We'll always, always be together.

00:19:53.390 --> 00:19:55.750
That was a strange dream.

00:19:58.140 --> 00:19:59.760
Oh my...

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:02.150
I had a weird dream!

00:20:02.150 --> 00:20:03.430
You did too?

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:05.030
So did I.

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:06.560
All of you did?

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:08.680
Don't tell me you did too?

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:25.700
Don't tell me you've caught a cold!

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:29.160
Come to think of it,
something may be off with me as well.

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:31.640
My head's a bit fuzzy too...

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:34.470
Goodness. That may be what caused it.

00:20:34.470 --> 00:20:36.850
We caught Ao-chan's cold.

00:20:36.850 --> 00:20:38.040
Oh my.

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:41.140
F.A. Girls should not have the capacity to catch colds!

00:20:41.140 --> 00:20:44.060
Initiating emergency debug program.

00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:48.320
Huh... We have to send this data,
that F.A. Girls can catch colds too!

00:20:51.110 --> 00:20:54.560
This time, I have to take care of you all, huh?

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:59.410
Once you're all better, I'll call Bukiko and we'll go to the amusement park!

00:21:10.480 --> 00:21:14.080
They'll soon show up at your door,

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:19.480
for my special someone, parts of hearts!

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:29.760
Counting the days I can't see you,

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:37.210
I want to hear your voice so badly I feel like crying!

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:40.700
I'm new to this world,

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:44.170
so I lack the language to describe it.

00:21:44.170 --> 00:21:46.440
To knockoffs, say...

00:21:46.440 --> 00:21:49.890
"No!" Take care to avoid them.

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:53.410
I want to be be dedicated!

00:21:56.800 --> 00:22:02.110
I want to build it all from nothing!

00:22:02.110 --> 00:22:05.340
We laugh and we fight,

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:08.950
creating our unique specs!

00:22:08.950 --> 00:22:14.870
By mixing love and hate,

00:22:14.870 --> 00:22:22.940
I want to create more of these funny, carefree days, the parts of Girl!

00:22:40.760 --> 00:22:43.060
Learning Mode: Amusement parks.

00:22:43.060 --> 00:22:46.100
Meow-Meow Cat has her own roller coaster, meow.

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:47.400
Let's all ride it together!

00:22:47.400 --> 00:22:47.970
Meow-Meow, huh?

00:22:47.970 --> 00:22:48.940
Battle! Battle!! Battle!!!
Hot Pot Day

00:22:48.940 --> 00:22:50.980
Next time on Frame Arms Girl...

00:22:50.980 --> 00:22:53.160
let's have another session, meow!

00:22:53.160 --> 00:22:54.460
Meow.

00:22:54.460 --> 00:22:54.990
Hot Pot Day
